<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63221" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐθότομ-ος</span></b>  (parox.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>for cutting
			stones</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄργανα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Agath.
					1.10
				</span></i>
			: Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ., ὁ</span>,
			prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιθοδόμος</span> in <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.2.11
			</span></i>; <i>quarryman,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12.347.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				22.1680.4
			</span></i>; <i>mason</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Thras.</u>
				43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PAmh.</u>
				2.76.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii/iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ., ὁ</span>, <i>surgeon who cuts for the stone</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				1.125
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Thras.</u>
				24
			</span></i>; but, <i>who cuts the stone</i> (internally), Ammonius 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cels.
					7.26.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ., τό</span>,
				<i>knife for cutting for the stone</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.60
			</span></i>.</div>
